    ["Keuangan", "ledger_accounts, ledger_transactions, journal_lines", "Rekening dan kantong sebagai akun ledger; transaksi dengan kunci idempotensi unik; baris jurnal double-entry"],
    ["Fitur nasabah", "pockets, favorite_recipients, paid_bills, virtual_cards", "Kantong dan locking, penerima favorit, tagihan terbayar, kartu virtual terenkripsi"],
